<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Harvey Norman half yr profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Harvey Norman half yr profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    26.94 vs 26.25</p>
<p>    Net				     18.14 vs 16.73</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     5.50 vs 5.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Harvey Norman Holdings Ltd is a franchisor of electrical and household goods stores.  </p>
<p>    Sales				   15.48 vs 7.21</p>
<p>    Other income			  73.21 vs 63.28</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 1.61 vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date May 2</p>
<p>Reg date April 16</p>
<p>    Tax				     10.42 vs 9.53</p>
<p>    Interest				 6.00 vs 4.01</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   6.54 vs 4.59</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
